Package: testmath
Title: Unit Tests for Mathematical Properties
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Stefano", "Barbieri", email = "sb3443@bath.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Inspired by 'testthat', 'testmath' aims to provide some functions
  for unit tests of mathematical properties in a readable manner. At the moment,
  these functions cover a few aspects of two distinct areas - unit tests for
  matrices and functions. Failure should provide detailed information for what 
  condition led to the test failing.
